    <briefdescription>
<para>Manages point-in-time, immutable project snapshots. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Snapshots are append-only: once created they are never modified. Integrity is guaranteed by a SHA-256 content checksum that is verified automatically on <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1projects_1_1_project_versioning_1addd6150e316d3876af7826c530e0293e" kindref="member">restoreSnapshot()</ref></computeroutput>.</para>
<para>All methods are thread-safe (protected by an internal shared_mutex).</para>
<para>Key RocksDB layout ────────────────── snap:&lt;uuid&gt; → <ref refid="structthemis_1_1projects_1_1_snapshot_meta" kindref="compound">SnapshotMeta</ref> JSON snap_idx:&lt;project_id&gt;:&lt;uuid&gt; → &quot;&quot; (index for listSnapshots) snap_data:&lt;uuid&gt;:&lt;doc_id&gt; → <ref refid="structthemis_1_1projects_1_1_document_meta" kindref="compound">DocumentMeta</ref> JSON (snapshot content) </para>
    </detaileddescription>
